Core k270 (unreleased) adds opt-in probe_model_capabilities(_f) (ADR 0032) that learns image_input from provider metadata (OpenRouter, Mistral, LM Studio, Ollama, llama.cpp). Knarr could probe once per routed engine (at startup/after discovery, cached, refreshed with discovery) so /api/show vision and the manifest are right for gateway/self-hosted models. Explicit, async, failures non-fatal (log). Gate on ->can('probe_model_capabilities_f') for older cores.
